rsive\n;; rules bound to % via :in (Datomic syntax; multiple bodies = OR,\n;; terminates on cyclic data). q returns a closed bounded result DaoStream.\n;; query/collect materializes conventional Datalog shapes.\n(query/collect\n  (query/q '[:find ?id ?task\n             :where [?id :work/status :todo]\n                    [?id :work/task ?task]]\ndocs/design/dao.space.md:182:;; terminates on cyclic data). q returns a closed bounded result DaoStream.\ndocs/design/dao.space.transactor.md:4:`:transactor` DaoStream type it replaces is deleted). This document is the\ndocs/design/dao.space.transactor.md:26:stream contract for either. The v1 `:transactor` DaoStream type — a\ndocs/design/dao.space.schema.md:247:is a library duty wrapping `dao.space.transactor`'s `:transactor` stream\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
